data.content:
Done. The component:

- **Generic** (`@typeparam TItem`) — works with any item type.
- **Immutable input** — `OnParametersSet` copies `Items` into an internal `_items` list; the original is never mutated.
- **Move Up / Move Down** buttons on each item, disabled at boundaries.
- **Notifies parent** via `OnOrderChanged` with a new list after each reorder.

Usage matches your example:

```razor
<SortableList Items="@tasks" OnOrderChanged="HandleReorder">
    <ItemTemplate>
        <span>@context.Title</span>
    </ItemTemplate>
</SortableList>

@code {
    private List<TaskItem> tasks = new() { /* ... */ };

    private void HandleReorder(List<TaskItem> updated)
    {
        tasks = updated;
    }
}
```
